{"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockList":[{"contentUdi":"umb://element/9f1c16a7b41a4631aeab147f067ad28c"},{"contentUdi":"umb://element/06a7374737c9435ca2cb3eb963cede32"},{"contentUdi":"umb://element/254977986cc446c18ba3c844792246bd"}]},"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"338ac17e-85de-40c4-8028-34adf753b3c6","udi":"umb://element/9f1c16a7b41a4631aeab147f067ad28c","PropType":null,"stringItemText":"Soil Testing"},{"contentTypeKey":"338ac17e-85de-40c4-8028-34adf753b3c6","udi":"umb://element/06a7374737c9435ca2cb3eb963cede32","PropType":null,"stringItemText":"Concrete Strength Testing"},{"contentTypeKey":"338ac17e-85de-40c4-8028-34adf753b3c6","udi":"umb://element/254977986cc446c18ba3c844792246bd","PropType":null,"stringItemText":"Asphalt Verification and Testing"}],"settingsData":[]}
</Value>
    </expertiseList>
    <grid>
      <Value>
{"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockGrid":[{"contentUdi":"umb://element/1979b0eeb04a421fbf3c8fe6567f7d7c","areas":[],"columnSpan":12,"rowSpan":1}]},"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"9a4f7c2e-1b3d-4e8a-bf01-7d62a8f5c930","udi":"umb://element/1979b0eeb04a421fbf3c8fe6567f7d7c","content":"\u003cdiv class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"758bl\" data-offset-key=\"dadl7-0-0\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"dadl7-0-0\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"dadl7-0-0\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRoadlab Bloemfontein is proud to have supported the \u003cstrong data-start=\"433\" data-end=\"471\"\u003eKoruson 1 Renewable Energy Project\u003c/strong\u003e, a landmark development forming part of South Africa’s Renewable Energy Independent Power Producer Programme (REIPPPP) Round 5. \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOnce operational, the project will generate low-carbon electricity capable of supplying approximately \u003cstrong data-start=\"911\" data-end=\"947\"\u003e193,000 South African households\u003c/strong\u003e, making a meaningful contribution to the country’s energy transition.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/mjjj2yii/koruson7.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/ur1bbjqi/koruson2.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp data-start=\"1039\" data-end=\"1196\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eThe leadership and technical oversight of \u003cstrong data-start=\"2179\" data-end=\"2197\"\u003eAnelisa Mafala\u003c/strong\u003e was crucial in maintaining our high standards.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1039\" data-end=\"1196\"\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003eRoadlab’s Role in this Project\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1039\" data-end=\"1196\"\u003eRoadlab was appointed to provide \u003cstrong data-start=\"1072\" data-end=\"1121\"\u003eongoing materials testing and quality control\u003c/strong\u003e in support of critical construction activities across the wind farm sites.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1198\" data-end=\"1217\"\u003eOur scope included:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1470\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1301\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1301\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1242\"\u003ePlate Load Testing\u003c/strong\u003e to determine the bearing capacity of turbine foundations\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1302\" data-end=\"1382\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1382\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1319\"\u003eCBR testing\u003c/strong\u003e to verify access road stability and foundation reinforcement\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1470\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1385\" data-end=\"1470\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOngoing field support\u003c/strong\u003e to ensure compliance with design and performance requirements\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1472\" data-end=\"1681\"\u003eThese tests are essential in ensuring that turbine foundations and access infrastructure are built on verified, stable ground — a non-negotiable requirement given the scale and loading of modern wind turbines.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1472\" data-end=\"1681\"\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/cz2b1r2b/koruson22.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/qvdmz4mj/koruson9.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/bp2h20at/koruson4.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003eInterested in our work?\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1039\" data-end=\"1196\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFill out the form below and we will reach out to you immediately.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}],"settingsData":[]}
</Value>
    </grid>
